scene B: The neighbour seems to have decided that {N} is the sort who will put up with it. {N} would like to show him otherwise.
scene R: {N} stands on the step in work clothes, keys in hand, and feels the heat climb up {Ns} neck.
scene G: A street works when people rub along. {N} has seen feuds over less run for twenty years and outlast everyone's patience.
